\subsubsection{Running-Sum Time Average}

Rather than storing the full trajectory $\{\COH^{(t)}\}$,
the time average is accumulated incrementally:
\begin{equation}
    S \;\leftarrow\; S + \COH(\sigma^{(t)}), \qquad
    \avgE{\COH}(T) = S / N_{\mathrm{sample}}.
